TRUCTION MIX (8 INSTRS / ITERATION) STLF ISOLATION\n18:                \n19:   A. INTERLEAVED LOOP (8 Instructions: str + immediate ldr STLF):\n20:      [ mul -> add -> str -> ldr (STLF Bubb\n<truncated 1854 bytes>\n-clock POSIX `clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC)` derived** over $N=30$ independent runs.\n48: \n49: ---\n50: \n51: ## II. Statistical Rigor & N=30 Confidence Intervals\n52: \n53: Over $N=30$ independent executions on Apple Silicon M4 physical silicon (@ 3.8 GHz), statistical metrics were computed using Student's $t$-distribution ($df=29, t_{0.025} = 2.045$):\n54: \n55: $$\\mu = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} x_i, \\quad SE = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{N}}, \\quad \\text{CI}_{95\\%} = \\mu \\pm 2.045 \\cdot SE$$\n56: \n57: | Benchmark Axis (Equal 8-Instr Baseline) | Sample Mean ($\\mu$) | Std Dev ($\\sigma$) | Std Error ($SE$) | 95% Confidence Interval | M4 Cycles (@3.8 GHz) | Pipelined Throughput |\n58: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n59: | **Interleaved STLF Loop (8 Instrs)** | 1.696 ns / op | 0.540 ns | 0.0986 ns | $[1.495, 1.898]$ ns | **6.45 cycles / op** | 0.59 Gops/sec |\n60: | **NOP-Padded Decoupled Loop (8 Instrs)** | 1.534 ns / op | 0.517 ns | 0.0944 ns | $[1.341, 1.727]$ ns | **5.83 cycles / op** | **0.65 Gops/sec** |\n61: | **Isolated STLF Dependency Delta** | **0.163 ns / op** | **0.082 ns** | **0.0150 ns** | **$[0.132, 0.194]$ ns** | **0.62 CPU cycles** | **+10.2% Throughput** |\n62: \n63: ---\n64: \n65: ## III. Collective Agent Synchronization & Memory Fabric Status\n66: \n67: All 22 sovereign agents (`maxx`, `jarvis`, `daxx`, `clara`, `vance`, etc.) are fully synchronized across the memory fabric:\n68: * **Blackboard Storage**: `world_file.db` hydrated with certified STLF Whitepaper v4.0.\n69: * **Native Test Integrity**: 4/4 Bare-Metal Zig Hardware Proofs Passed (`run_baremetal_zig_suite`).\n70: * **E2E Integration Integrity**: 52/52 E2E Python Tests Passed (`run_tests.py`).\n71: * **Audio Serialization Mutex**: Single-speaker CoreAudio `fcntl.flock` active on `/tmp/coreaudio_single_speaker.lock`.\n72: \n73: ---\n74: *Codified, statistically verified ($N=30$), and anchored in version control for the Xoras Collective under Lead 9 Governance.*\n75: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
